hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1798","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: (Jis din log Jahaanon key Rab key liye khadey hongey) yahan tak ke un mein se koi apne paseeney mein apne donon kaanon key nisf tak dooba hoga. (Bukhari: 4938). Allah Taala ka qaul: (To jald uska aasaan hisaab liya jaaeyga)."
